{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24849","headline":"秋夜桂州宴送郑十九侍御 · 杨衡","name":"秋夜桂州宴送郑十九侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋至触物愁，况当离别筵。\n短歌销夜烛，繁绪遍高弦。\n桂水舟始泛，兰堂榻讵悬。\n一盃勾离阻，三载奉周旋。\n鸦噪更漏飒，露濡风景鲜。\n斯须不共此，且爲更留连。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24849.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24849","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}